  "description": "Operating Area: Turkey, Greece\n\nStep onto Perla Del Mar 1 and feel the character of a classic wooden gulet carefully built for easy, comfortable days on the water. With its rich mahogany interiors, warm lighting, and the familiar charm of traditional craftsmanship, the yacht creates a setting that feels instantly welcoming.\n\nPerla Del Mar 1 is designed for guests who enjoy quiet moments at anchor, long conversations around the table, and the simple pleasure of sailing along the Turkish coast. With six Double cabins and two Twin cabins, every guest finds a cozy, private space to unwind. The well-kept decks, inviting lounge areas, and attentive crew make it easy to settle into a relaxed rhythm from the first day.\n\nWhether you're swimming in calm turquoise bays, heading ashore to discover small coastal towns, or resting under the shade with a gentle sea breeze, Perla Del Mar 1 offers a holiday that feels unhurried and personal, a place where each day blends into the next and the journey becomes the memory.",
